      "value": "The only way would be to completely remove custom shader support, which obviously wouldn't fly at all. It's impossible to just selectively hinder screenspace functions on uploaded shaders.\n\nAlso since you seem unaware of it, you can just use custom settings on your safety system to disallow shaders/particles on trusted users.",
