      "value": "@{5c1d007d3d7a0912aaff65e8|full_name}: That's not a solution to screenspace shaders being extremely abuseable, more than any other shader type about.\nSure you can block every avatar, but the game is considerably worse that way you may as well not even play.\nScreenspace shaders are used almost exclusively for the kind of avatars you end up blocking.",
