      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You can disable shaders for everyone. Then as you meet people, you can actually go into the menu and click the Show Avatar button which overrides your safety settings and enables everything for them. Doing this one at a time makes it easier to undo and block someone if an abusive \"blinder\" shader is on. I used to just have avatars off for everyone and then enable them one at a time as I approach people.",
      "viewerReactions": null
