      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unless developers would manually greenlight each and every avatar, that wouldn't be really possible. Even if there was a restriction in how big that \"Shader sphere\" can be, you could still bother people with a smaller version.\n\nYou have safety settings, you have performance limiter. I'd argue those two things already do a great job at preventing what you just said. Simply disable custom animations and 99% of your problems will be gone.",
      "viewerReactions": null
